<title>USA: American List Corp Q4 Feb 28 net falls.</title>
<headline>American List Corp Q4 Feb 28 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MINEOLA, N.Y. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>Feb. 28, 1997  Feb. 29, 1996  Feb. 28, 1997  Feb. 29, 1996  Revenues     $18,471,146 $18,886,844 $ 5,031,438 $ 5,665,313</p>
<p> Net earnings   6,748,423   7,609,022   1,826,531   2,490,369</p>
<p>Net earnings</p>
<p>  per share	    1.51	  1.68	   .41	   .55</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding   4,462,421   4,542,397   4,438,739   4,541,403</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its decline in earnings for year-end 1997 reflects a decrease in sales and about $300,000 in legal and accounting fees related to its pending merger with Snyder Communications Inc.</p>
<p>The company said it reevaluated its GeoDemX subsidiary and wrote-off about $98,000 of goodwill.</p>
</text>
